        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Janky Golf with Stream</strong> turns mini golf into a fully <strong>interactive Twitch</strong> experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Streamers</strong> can <strong>host games</strong> where <strong>viewers</strong> take <strong>control</strong> of the <strong>ball</strong> using <strong>chat commands</strong> like !rot, !aim, and !hit, or use the <strong>Twitch extension</strong> for drag and click aiming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can <strong>design their own maps</strong> and share their creations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up rotations for <strong>automated, unattended</strong> play sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s lighthearted, unpredictable, and designed for laughs. The physics aren’t perfect, but they <strong>are</strong> free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twitch integrated viewer controls (!rot, !aim, !hit).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional Twitch extension with mouse based aiming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom map creation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto rotation for unattended streams.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely free to play (Twitch account required to host or join).</p></li></ul>",
